                <p>Dr. Vicente Benites, minister resident of the superior court of justice, has
                    issued and signed the foregoing order.</p>
                <p>Porto Viejo, February 4, 1885, at 1 o’clock p.m.</p>
                <p>Before me.</p>
                <closer><signed>MOLINA</signed>.</closer>
